PROVENANCE NOTE - read before relying on this licence

This package is a build of the dsh-computer-use-fast component that ships with the
DeepSeek Harness, with modifications (see PLUGIN-RELEASE-NOTES.md): the computer_ocr
tool and packaging changes.

It depends on @deepseek-ai/dsh-tools and is a DeepSeek Harness component rather than
an independent work. The MIT text above is a placeholder chosen so the package is
legally explicit rather than silent. If the upstream licence differs, or if you do
not hold the rights to redistribute the original, replace this file.

Do not publish until this note has been resolved.